{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RLLL: Tower of Choices is a single-player game that blends party-based RPG mechanics with deck-building and roguelite elements. As you control the main character, you'll face numerous choices throughout your journey. Recruit diverse companions, collect various artifacts, and learn different skills to create your unique combination as you uncover the tower's mysteries.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343690/extras/396730323897ec07c45722f47deb9968.poster.avif?t=1770168055\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343690/extras/396730323897ec07c45722f47deb9968.webm?t=1770168055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343690/extras/396730323897ec07c45722f47deb9968.mp4?t=1770168055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Board and Dice System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game uses a dice-rolling system for movement. This mechanic interacts with various artifact effects, allowing you to add dice, move backwards, or gain benefits from selecting specific dice numbers. It creates an engaging experience beyond simply choosing the next tile to move to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343690/extras/33f461570305dcae6399738edf3159f2.poster.avif?t=1770168055\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343690/extras/33f461570305dcae6399738edf3159f2.webm?t=1770168055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343690/extras/33f461570305dcae6399738edf3159f2.mp4?t=1770168055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Class Advancement and Skill Trees</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player character has their unique skill tree, and after learning enough skills, they can advance into different classes. Each class advancement grants additional skill trees, and your abilities evolve to match your chosen class concept.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343690/extras/5aa26d36441968f9d2817d18d8c48aa3.avif?t=1770168055\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meaningful Choices</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tower of Choices offers various decisions throughout gameplay. Choose your rewards, select companions, and decide whether to recruit or subdue other adventurers you encounter. You can choose to help those in peril - or not. Every choice meaningfully impacts your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343690/extras/ab7b16db0eb331946d2a34e67d871921.avif?t=1770168055\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A massive, ominous tower stands as a symbol of the &quot;Age of Despair,&quot; when our world was shattered by human cruelty. When rumors spread that &quot;your wishes can come true if you climb the tower,&quot; adventurers begin their journey, each carrying their own dreams. What secrets lie within this tower filled with dangers and mysteries?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343690/extras/df6099d81b0387c0750893084344a8cf.avif?t=1770168055\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replay Value</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With various classes, advancement options, companions, artifacts, and skill books, you can create countless unique combinations. Discover your own distinct synergies and enjoy different playstyles with each run!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Artifact Hater","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3343690/dd11fa2bf87e12905f2f6160f014769b457e409e.jpg"},{"name":"Artifact Avoider","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3343690/9245e7c900c32d6930f1ea2743ab5a2480f8d6f7.jpg"},{"name":"Gold Dragon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3343690/24792d5e318b10924eeb21c7eb186838552c98d9.jpg"},{"name":"Gold Hoarder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3343690/ce695681c7bd4b7e01f202622faa2829ae6c20fd.jpg"},{"name":"Gold Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3343690/3190737ae12d57926449cf46a098b9e098dbc953.jpg"},{"name":"Sweep","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3343690/3a65b7a9a0deea669a2134c2932e7c563a296efb.jpg"},{"name":"Absolute Evil","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3343690/2c126acc54b945a6732dc5940fe538294e948ef5.jpg"},{"name":"Absolute Good","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3343690/8e1566379b91dfc82847129d668ff7af5905028e.jpg"},{"name":"Chef","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3343690/8dd4c1d9ebd86f74a44326d62afae37bed92d93d.jpg"},{"name":"Ascetic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3343690/f25032eec5acbbc35da1af91b954049558c03a04.jpg"}],"total":54},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3343690?t=1770168055","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343690/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770168055","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343690/7a60cd125a217c249c3059fc09b4d7c7319e7f0e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770168055","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343690/7a60cd125a217c249c3059fc09b4d7c7319e7f0e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770168055","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3863930,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RLLL: Tower of Choices is a single-player game that blends party-based RPG mechanics with deck-building and roguelite elements. As you control the main character, you'll face numerous choices throughout your journey. Recruit diverse companions, collect various artifacts, and learn different skills to create your unique combination as you uncover the tower's mysteries.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343690/extras/396730323897ec07c45722f47deb9968.poster.avif?t=1770168055\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343690/extras/396730323897ec07c45722f47deb9968.webm?t=1770168055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343690/extras/396730323897ec07c45722f47deb9968.mp4?t=1770168055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Board and Dice System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game uses a dice-rolling system for movement. This mechanic interacts with various artifact effects, allowing you to add dice, move backwards, or gain benefits from selecting specific dice numbers. It creates an engaging experience beyond simply choosing the next tile to move to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343690/extras/33f461570305dcae6399738edf3159f2.poster.avif?t=1770168055\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343690/extras/33f461570305dcae6399738edf3159f2.webm?t=1770168055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343690/extras/33f461570305dcae6399738edf3159f2.mp4?t=1770168055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Class Advancement and Skill Trees</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player character has their unique skill tree, and after learning enough skills, they can advance into different classes. Each class advancement grants additional skill trees, and your abilities evolve to match your chosen class concept.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343690/extras/5aa26d36441968f9d2817d18d8c48aa3.avif?t=1770168055\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meaningful Choices</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tower of Choices offers various decisions throughout gameplay. Choose your rewards, select companions, and decide whether to recruit or subdue other adventurers you encounter. You can choose to help those in peril - or not. Every choice meaningfully impacts your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343690/extras/ab7b16db0eb331946d2a34e67d871921.avif?t=1770168055\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A massive, ominous tower stands as a symbol of the &quot;Age of Despair,&quot; when our world was shattered by human cruelty. When rumors spread that &quot;your wishes can come true if you climb the tower,&quot; adventurers begin their journey, each carrying their own dreams. What secrets lie within this tower filled with dangers and mysteries?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343690/extras/df6099d81b0387c0750893084344a8cf.avif?t=1770168055\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replay Value</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With various classes, advancement options, companions, artifacts, and skill books, you can create countless unique combinations. Discover your own distinct synergies and enjoy different playstyles with each run!</p>","developers":["Team5D"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343690/header.jpg?t=1770168055","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3343690/1524036383/412c6801c4631c046657be4e8de7a154036f7a7b/1769018807/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769024919","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3343690/1524036383/412c6801c4631c046657be4e8de7a